      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ponemah%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Ponemah post office has operated continuously since 1901, marking over a century of local mail service.",
