      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ponemah%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Ponemah sits at 48.04° north latitude and 94.90° west longitude, placing it just north of the 48th parallel.",
